# Guidelines to do when adding comments.

## DONT's
1. Dont add comments to imports
2. Dont add comments to exports
3. Dont add comments to config files
4. Don't add comments to variables
5. Don't add comments to React States
6. Don't add comments per line of code

## DO's
1. Add comments to explain function logic
2. Add comments to explain a block of code / multiple lines of code
